{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["If you take a pledge — by means of the court, as it is written: ״בחוץ תעמוד והאיש אשר אתה נושה בו יוציא אליך את העבוט החוצה״. But you shall not enter his house to take his pledge. And this is: ״לא תהיה לו כנושה״." "Until the sun comes — all day you return it to him, for the Sages interpreted it as a daytime garment."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:40.005641098Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}